ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雰囲気すごく好きなんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本格的にイラストや絵を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描いたことある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校は美術がないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はちゃんと描いたことないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小中学校で賞撮ったことあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい紙に細かい絵を描いたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"図工すきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？まりかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爬虫類平気な人だっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平気というかすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トカゲとかヤモリとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から見た形がすきで、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔もすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤモリの手足は特にすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワニもすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家は調整豆乳ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは調整？それとも無調整？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text"